{
  "id": "MRK.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Maliko 10",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 52,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būbi bo kūbūlaga kaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbūūka wīnga a henaho, ūkīla mongo gwa Yolodani, wingīla mu sī ya Būyudaya. Mabita mataale gūnondeela hangī, wandya kūbalanga gīt'ūmo wītīlaga shikū jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bafalisayo balebe būng'wegeela kūngema, būmūja gīkī, “Angū ū ngosha azunīlīgije ū kūmpeeja ū nke okwe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūshosha alībabūja gīkī, “Ū Musa amulagīlile ginehe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo būhaya, “Ū Musa azunīlīgije kūng'wandīkīla talaka na kūneka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūbashokeja ūhaya gīkī, “Ī shilagīlo shenīsho akang'winha kūlwa nguno ya būgang'hanazu bong'holò jing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a ha wandījo wa kūseema, ū Mulungu akabaseema ngosha na nkīma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose hū kūhaya ū munhū akūneka ise na nina adimane na nke okwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu būbīlī wabo bakūbiza mīlī gūmò, batī babīlī hangī, balī mīlī gūmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa nguno yenīyo, abo badimanyiwe na Mulungu, atizigela munhū wa kūbalekanya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho alī mu kaya, būmūja hangī a bahemba bakwe ī mihayo yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbawīla ūhaya gīkī, “Būlī ng'wene ūlū ūneka nke wakwe ūtoola ūngī akūbiza alīshihya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū nkīma ūlū ūneka ngoshi ūūkatoolwa kūngī, nang'hwe akūbiza alīshihya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu na banīgīnī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'wenhela na banīgīnī gīkī abakuumye, gwike a bahemba būbahama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yesu aho wabona gīko ūsaaya. Ūbawīla gīkī, “Bazunīlījagi a baana bize a halī nene, mutabahangījage. Nguno ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu būlī wabo a ba mbika yenīyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmuwīla gwa ng'hana gīkī, ose ose ūyo atūwanukūla ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu gītī ng'wana, atīko ū kwingīla mo na hado yaya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbakumbatīla na makono gakwe, hama ūbatūūlīla makono, hūna ūbafuha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlemeelwa kwa ngosha nsabi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha numa ya yenīyo ūbūūka ajile. Aho alī mu nzīla, kūhayimanīla munhū ūmò washika alīmpeeleela, ūshikīla kūntugīja mazwi. Ūmūja gīkī, “Nangi wawiza, nīīte mhayo kī nabize ng'wingīji ū mu būpanga butashilaga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūng'wīla, “Nibūlī ūlīnitana wawiza? Atīho wawiza nūūlū ūmò, ūlū atī Mulungu wike! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe ūshimanile ī shilagīlo ūmo shihayīlile; ī gīkī, ‘Yaya ū kūbūlaga, Yaya ū kūshihya, Yaya ū kwiba, Yaya ū kūkaanīla būlomolomo, Yaya ū kūnyeecha, Nkūjage so na noko.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūng'wīla gīkī, “Nangi ī yenīyī nīdimile pyī kūfuma ha būyanda bone.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūnkalalīla mu būtogwa būtaale, hūna ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ūlīleba ho mhayo gūmò, jaga ūkashijinje ī shikolo īsho ūlī nasho ūbinhe bahabī, ūkūbiza na wibīkīja wa sabo ng'wigūlū, hūna wize ūnilondeele.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei aho wagwigwa ū mhayo gwenūyo, ūgwa loolo ū mīlī, wīnga ho onzololokaga, nguno walī na sabo ningī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yesu wandya kūbalola lola pye a bahemba bakwe, hama ūbawīla gīkī, “Īlī shilambu no abo balī na sabo ū kwingīla ū mu būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bahemba bakakumya aho wahaya gīko. Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūshosha hangī ūbawīla gīkī, “Bing'we baana, īlī shilambu no ū kwingīla ū mu būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo īlī shinogu ī ngamīla ū kūbīta mu kapūndū ka lūshinge, kūtinda ū nsabi kwingīla mu būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho a kakumīje kabo kakakīlanīja. Bandya kwiwīla gīkī, “Yee! Alīyo lūūlū, nani ūyo adūgije ū kūpīla?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūbakalalīla, hūna ūbawīla gīkī, “Ū gwenūyū gūtadūlīkanile ū kū banhū, alīyo ū kūlī Mulungu ītī gīko, nguno ū kūlī Mulungu pyī ī yose īdūlīkanile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Petelo ūng'wīla, “Ī gīsī angū ūlībona gīkī a bise twaleka pyī ī shose kūlwa kūkūlondeela bebe!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūhaya, “Nalīmuwīla gwa ng'hana gīkī, atīho nūūlū ūmò ūyo waleka numba nūūlū baana ba ng'wawe bagosha na bakīma, nūūlū nina, nūūlū ise, nūūlū baana bakwe, nūūlū malaale kūlwa nguno yane na kūlwa nguno ya Ng'hūlū Jawiza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyo atanukūla numba ng'hangala igana ī haha ū ng'wikanza īlī, na baana ba ng'wawe na balūmbūye, na banina, na baana bakwe, na malaale, hamò na būluhi; hama ū ng'wikanza īlo līliza akūpandīka būpanga butashilaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo balīho bingī abo balī kū būtongi, bakūbiza kū numa; na a babo balī kū numa, abo bakūbiza kū būtongi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūbawīla hangī ya kūcha na kūjūūka kwakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalī mu lūgendo, mu nzīla ya kūlinha kūja Yelusalemu, ū Yesu walī kū būtongi wabo. Nīyo baja balīkumya no, hama abo balondeelaga baalī bogoha kīngī nasho! Hūna ūbasola abo ikūmi na babīlī ūbapūnja ha mhūjo, wandya kūbawīla īyo īlang'wilongele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya gīkī, “Ī haha tūlīlinha kūja Yelusalemu, ū Ng'wana wa Munhū akūjūtūūlwa mu makono ga bagabīji bataale na balangi ba shilagīlo, banamule nsango gwa kūbūlagwa. Ha numa bakūntūūla mu makono ga banhū ba mahanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bangīmbe nyachilū na kūnswīla mate na kūntūla, hama bakūmūlaga. Alīyo akūjūūka ha numa ya shikū idatū.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūkooba būtaale",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūhayimanīla bang'wegeela ba Yakobo na Yohana, a bitūnja ba ng'wa Zebedayo, būshika būng'wīla gīkī, “Nangi tūlī na mhayo tūtogilwe ūtwītīle.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbashokeja ūbawīla, “Mutogilwe nang'wītīle kī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būnshokeja balīhaya, “Lagīlaga gīkī, a bise būbīlī wise tūligashe nang'ho ū ng'wikūjo lyako; ūmò kū būlyo wako, ūngī kū lūmoso lwako!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūbawīla, “A bing'we angū mutagūmanile ūyo mulīgūlomba! Mudūgije kūshing'wa ī shikombe īsho nalīshing'wa ū nene? Nūūlū mudūgije kūbatījiwa ū būbatīījiwa ūbo nalībatīījiwa ū nene?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būnshokeja gīkī, “Tūdūgije!” Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūbawīla, “Ī shikombe īsho nalīshing'wa ū nene mukūshing'wa, nū būbatīījiwa ūbo nalībatīījiwa ū nene mukūbatījiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū gwa kwigasha kū nkono gwane gwa būlyo na gwa lūmoso, gūtī gwa kūmuzunīlīja nene, ū gwenūyo gūlī gwa banhū abo balonja longejiwe!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo ikūmi aho bigwa bakabapelanīla a ba Yakobo nū Yohana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yesu ūbitana pye a bose; ūbawīla, “Mumanile gīkī abo bakanukūlagwa na banhū ba mahanga kūbiza basugi h'abo bakabalomaga, na gīkī a bataale mubo h'abo bakabatūmamyaga bo nguzu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū bing'we ītigeleelilwe ībize gīko, alīyo būlī ng'wene ūyo atogilwe kūbiza ntaale ū mu bing'we, shing'wigeleelilwe abize ntūmami wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū yūyo atogilwe kūbiza ntongeeji ū mu bing'we abize nsese wa bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nū Ng'wana wa Munhū atizile kūtūmamīlwa, alīyo kūtūmama na kūfunya būpanga bokwe kūbiza shikomoolelo kūlwa nguno ya bingī.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpījiwa kwa mboku Batimayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose būshika Yeliko, aho alīnga ū mu nzengo gwenūyo walī nabo na a bahemba bakwe, hamò n'ibita itaale. Walīho na munhū mboku akasangwa wigashaga haho na nzīla alilombeleja; ī lina lyakwe witanagwa Batimayo, ng'wana Timayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wigwa gīkī Yesu wa Nazaleti, wandya kūhamuka n'ilaka lya higūlya alīhaya, “Yesu Ng'wana wa ng'wa Daūdi, nikūlīlagwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bingī būyūng'hama gīkī ahuumūle, alīyo ū wei hū ongeja ū kūhamuka alīhaya, “Ka nikūlīlagwe Ng'wana wa ng'wa Daūdi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu wīmīīla ūbawīla, “Ng'witanagi.” Būng'witana ū mboku balīng'wīla gīkī, “Timbyaga ng'holò, būūkaga alīkwitana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wīponya ī kabbuudi yakwe, wikīndīka ng'wigūlya, hūna ūgangīla ajile ū kūlī Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūmūja alīhaya, “Ūtogilwe nakwītīle kī?” Nang'hwe ū mboku ūnshokeja alīng'wīla, “Nangi ka nabone!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yesu ūng'wīla, “Jaga ū kūzunya kwako kwakūpījaga.” Na ng'hana haho na haho, ī likanza lyenīlo wandya kūbona, ūja nang'hwe ū mu nzīla alīnondeela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
